Package: wan30
Type: Package
Title: Client for a 'Wan30' Video Account
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Wan30", role = "aut"),
    person("NotUsingGithub", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "66665951+NotUsingGithub@users.noreply.github.com",
           comment = "https://github.com/NotUsingGithub"))
Description: Client for a wan30.video account. It speaks the same Streamable
    HTTP MCP endpoint as the Wan30 command line client: POST {origin}/api/mcp/.
    Purchased wan30.video credits are required for generation. Sign-up,
    check-in and gift credits alone do not qualify. Estimation does not spend
    credits. Generation does not call the service unless confirm_spend is
    TRUE, and that flag is not sent. This is not an official Alibaba,
    DashScope, or Tongyi client.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://wan30.video/, https://wan30.video/mcp/,
    https://wan30.video/mcp/guide/, https://wan30.video/cli/,
    https://github.com/NotUsingGithub/wan30-mcp
BugReports: https://github.com/NotUsingGithub/wan30-mcp/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: curl, jsonlite
NeedsCompilation: no
